                },
                {
                  "id": "p-roi-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing the right dry van trailer weight capacity isn't just about compliance; it's about long-term profitability.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-roi-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>A trailer with optimized weight and capacity can help operators:</strong>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-roi-3",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Haul more freight per trip"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Improve fuel efficiency"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Reduce strain on equipment"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Maintain higher resale value"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-roi-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When your equipment works efficiently, every load becomes more valuable. That's why many owner-operators focus closely on semi-trailer capacity and dry van sizes before making a purchase.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-choosing",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing the Right Dry Van Trailer",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "choosing"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choosing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Every trucking operation has different needs. Some operators prioritize maximum payload capacity, lightweight construction, long-haul durability, or ease of maintenance. At Sun State Trailers, we help operators evaluate the options that make the most sense for their routes, freight types, and business goals. Because when your trailer works as hard as you do, the whole operation runs smoother.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-find-right-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're comparing dry van trailer weight capacity, sizes, and payload specifications, the best next step is reviewing real equipment options. At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, you can explore a wide selection of dependable trailers designed to keep your trucks moving and your business profitable.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "find-right"
